DESCRIPTION:

	SGML parser. To parse an SGML file, create this stream which
	is a parser. The stream get a DTD structure from its target.
	Hence, in addition to being a HTStructured stream, the target
	*MUST* add method MSG_HT_STRUCTURED_GET_DTD.

	"text/html"  ---> SGML parser ---> "text/xgw-html"

	$Id: sgml.goc,v 1.26.1.11 97/11/18 17:03:43 grisco Exp $

